{{Classic Era}}
Ethereal Mist is a planar armor set for [[Cleric|Clerics]]. It drops as part of [[Classic Planar Armor: Group 1|Group 1 Armor Sets]] in the [[Plane of Hate]] and [[Plane of Fear]]. The named target that always drops two pieces of this armor is [[High Priest M`kari]] in the [[Plane of Hate]].

